{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14416","headline":"柳花歌送客往桂阳 · 戴叔伦","name":"柳花歌送客往桂阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧浪渡头柳花发，断续因风飞不绝。\n摇烟拂水积翠间，缀雪含霜谁忍攀。\n夹岸纷纷送君去，鸣櫂孤寻到何处。\n移家深入桂水源，种柳新成花更繁。\n定知别後消散尽，却忆今朝伤旅魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}